          %h3#ConstructionInHomotopyTypeTheory In homotopy type theory
          %p
            If we unwind the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categorical+semantics"} categorical semantics
            of the
            %a{:href => "#InHomotopyTypeTheory"} above definition
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
