                  \\big)
                  \\Big\}
          %p
            of the homotopy pullback in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"} homotopy type theory
            %a{:href => "#ConstructionsGeneral"} above prescription
            for how to construct homotopy pullbacks.
          %p
            So let the ambient category be a suitable
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type-theoretic+model+category"} type-theoretic model category
          .num_example
            %h6#example Example
            %p
              The type
