              of substitution is given by
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullback
              of the fibrations that interpret the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+types"} dependent types
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
