            %p
              Forming the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+sum"} dependent sum
              over
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi a
                    %mo :
                    %mi A
                    %mo ,
                    %mi b
                    %mo :
                    %mi B
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} a : A, b : B
              is simply interpreted as regarding the resulting object
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi f
                    %mo ,
                    %mi g
                    %msup
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mo *
                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mi I
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (f,g)^* C^I
              as an object in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                    %mo ≃
                    %msub
                      %mi 𝒞
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
