                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}_{/ A \times B}
            %p
              Since by assumption on the categorical interpretation of a type, all objects here are fibrant, this coincides with the expression of the homotopy pullback from corollary
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#HomotopyPullbackByFactorizationLemma"}
              above.
          .num_example
            %h6#example_2 Example
            %p
              Specifically, let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
