            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+limit"} homotopy limit
            \.
          %p
            Homotopy pullbacks are at least mentioned in almost any textbook on
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
          %p Dedicated textbook introductions:
          %ul
            %li
